  "date_key": "2026-11-02",
  "date_cn": "2026年11月02日",
  "day_cn": "周一",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-02-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-02-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">拖延与自律 (Procrastination &amp; The ADHD Brain)</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I swear my brain is just <strong>a browser with 100 tabs open</strong> right now. I’ve been staring at this report for three hours, and I haven&#x27;t written a single word.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Tell me about it. You’ve been <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">pacing back and forth</span> all morning. Are you experiencing <strong>analysis paralysis</strong> again?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Exactly. There’s so much data that I just don&#x27;t know where to start. Instead of writing, I’ve been <strong>bike-shedding</strong>—spending forty-five minutes choosing the perfect font for the title page.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Classic avoidance tactic. You always <strong>drag your heels</strong> when it comes to financial summaries. Why do you always <strong>put it on the long finger</strong>?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I think it’s my <strong>time blindness</strong>. I keep telling myself I can finish it in an hour, but the deadline is tomorrow and I’m completely <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">under the gun</span>. Yet, somehow, I managed to <strong>hyperfocus on</strong> rearranging my desk drawers.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Ah, yes. I noticed you created another <strong>doom pile</strong> of random cables and receipts in the corner. You know, you really need someone to <strong>light a fire under</strong> you when you get like this.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I know, I know. I just need to <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">bite the bullet</span> and start typing.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Look, just set a timer for twenty minutes and <strong>power through</strong> the introduction. Don&#x27;t worry about making it perfect. Once you <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">get the ball rolling</span>, the rest will be much easier.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">You&#x27;re right. I’m closing all these unnecessary tabs—literally and figuratively. Let’s get this done.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：我发誓我现在的大脑就像<strong>一个开了100个标签页的浏览器</strong>（a browser with 100 tabs open）。我盯着这份报告看了三个小时，一个字都没写出来。</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：可不是嘛。你一上午都在<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">来回踱步</span>。你是不是又陷入<strong>分析瘫痪</strong>（analysis paralysis）了？</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：完全正确。数据太多了，我简直不知道从哪儿下手。我没有在写报告，反而一直在<strong>纠结鸡毛蒜皮的细节</strong>（bike-shedding）——花了四十五分钟给扉页选一个完美的字体。</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：典型的逃避策略。一到写财务总结的时候你就<strong>故意拖延</strong>（drag your heels）。你为什么总是<strong>把它无限期搁置</strong>（put it on the long finger）呢？</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：我觉得是因为我的<strong>时间盲点</strong>（time blindness）。我总跟自己说我能在一小时内写完，但截止日期就是明天了，我现在彻底<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">压力山大</span>。然而，我不知怎么地居然<strong>极度专注地</strong>（hyperfocus on）重新整理了我的书桌抽屉。</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：啊，对。我注意到你在角落里又弄出了一个由各种随意乱放的线缆和收据组成的<strong>杂物堆</strong>（doom pile）。你知道，你这副样子的时候，真的很需要有人<strong>给你施加点压力/激励你一下</strong>（light a fire under）。</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：我知道，我知道。我只需要<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">咬紧牙关</span>开始打字就行了。</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：听着，就定个二十分钟的闹钟，然后<strong>咬牙坚持做完</strong>（power through）引言部分。别管完不完美。一旦你<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">开了个头</span>，剩下的就会容易多了。</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：你说得对。我要关掉所有这些没用的标签页——字面意义上和精神意义上都是。咱们把它搞定吧。</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>a browser with 100 tabs open</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 大脑像开了无数标签页的浏览器（形容思绪混乱、同时想着很多事情，常用于形容多动症/ADHD特征）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用/网络流行</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述注意力分散、思绪过载时。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>analysis paralysis</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 分析瘫痪（因过度思考或分析过多选项而导致无法做出决定或采取行动）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用/职场</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 面对复杂任务或选择时，因想得太多而停滞不前。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>bike-shedding</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 在琐碎的事情上浪费时间（而忽略真正重要的问题，源自帕金森琐碎定律）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用/科技与商业圈</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述在拖延时把精力花在无关紧要的细节上。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>drag one&#x27;s heels</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 故意拖延；磨洋工</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国/美国通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述某人因为不情愿而故意放慢做事速度或推迟行动。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>put something on the long finger</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 无限期推迟某事；把某事束之高阁</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 爱尔兰</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 表达一再拖延、不想面对某项任务。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>time blindness</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 时间盲点；时间感知障碍（难以准确感知时间流逝的速度或预估任务所需时间，ADHD社群常用语）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用/心理学与流行文化</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 解释为什么总是低估任务时间或经常迟到。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>hyperfocus on</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 极度关注于；过度沉浸于（一种精神高度集中的状态，常忽略周围其他事物，ADHD常见症状）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 本该做正事，却把几个小时的惊人专注力花在毫无意义的消遣上。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>doom pile / doom box</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 末日杂物堆/盲盒（Didn&#x27;t Organize, Only Moved 的首字母缩写；指逃避整理时随便把东西堆在一起形成的杂乱堆积物）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用/Gen Z / 互联网流行</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述因为缺乏执行力而产生的杂物堆。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>light a fire under (someone)</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 督促某人；给某人施加压力以促使其行动</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国/全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 需要外部刺激或严厉手段来打破拖延状态时。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>power through</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 咬牙坚持到底；努力熬过（艰难或无聊的过程）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 克服不想做事的阻力，强行集中精力完成任务。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Structural teacher vulnerability and institutional discourse</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">10.1080/09518398.2026.2736694</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">teacher structural vulnerability institutional discourse bilingual education emotional labor</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">延伸已发表的教师结构性脆弱研究，而不是泛泛推荐教师压力或倦怠文献。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找能把个人遭遇转化为制度机制的概念或方法，尤其关注责任、保护、可信度与教师声音。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
  "mentor": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0;color:#555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8\">（今日暂无可精读的论文，请稍后查看）</p>",
  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/02/2003866988\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">台湾抗议APEC“歧视”待遇</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Taiwan protests APEC ‘discrimination’</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">台湾外交部对APEC峰会期间，台湾代表团成员证件被没收并遭到不公平对待表示抗议，认为此举是对台湾的“歧视”，并呼吁APEC成员国关注此事件。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/11/01/hit-podcasts-reveal-the-angst-of-chinas-youth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">热门播客揭示中国年轻一代的焦虑</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Hit podcasts reveal the angst of China’s youth</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">多档中国热门播客节目深入探讨了当下中国年轻人的生活困境与心理状态，揭示了他们面临的就业压力、社会竞争以及未来不确定性带来的普遍性焦虑。（独立媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3372879/joshua-cooper-ramo-whether-us-can-handle-stress-test-chinas-rise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">约书亚·库珀·拉莫：美国能否承受中国崛起带来的压力测试？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Joshua Cooper Ramo on whether the US can handle the stress test of China’s rise</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">资深外交政策专家约书亚·库珀·拉莫分析了中国崛起对美国构成的全方位挑战，探讨了美国在政治、经济和战略层面如何应对这种“压力测试”及其可能的影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/ideas/2026/11/haley-stevens-sending-wrong-message/689250/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">海莉·史蒂文斯发出了错误的信息</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Haley Stevens Is Sending the Wrong Message</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">针对美国国会议员海莉·史蒂文斯近期发表的言论或采取的行动，评论指出其可能传递了不恰当或具有误导性的信息，引发了公众或政治圈的争议。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/30/artificial-intelligence-ai-revolution-technology-history-luddites/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">人工智能尚未引发革命</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">AI Isn’t a Revolution—Yet</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">文章指出，尽管人工智能技术发展迅速，但目前它仍处于发展的早期阶段，尚未达到能彻底改变社会和经济格局的“革命性”水平，提醒人们客观看待其影响。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/11/01/chris-murphy-stroke-hospitalized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">参议员克里斯·墨菲中风入院治疗</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Sen. Chris Murphy hospitalized after suffering stroke</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国康涅狄格州联邦参议员克里斯·墨菲因突发中风入院接受治疗，目前情况稳定。此事引发了对其健康状况和参议院工作影响的关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/01/nx-s1-6025502/stroke-acronym-be-fast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">您了解中风的症状吗？记住“BE FAST”口诀是关键</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Do you know signs of a stroke? BE FAST are the words to remember</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">此新闻提醒公众识别中风的早期症状，强调“BE FAST”口诀的重要性，包括平衡、眼睛、面部、手臂、言语和时间等五个关键方面，旨在提高民众对中风的认知，以便及时就医，挽救生命。（健康科普）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/russia-s-giant-new-radar-in-kaliningrad-raises-alarm-in-nato/a-79797815?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">俄罗斯在加里宁格勒部署新型巨型雷达，引发北约警惕</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Russia&#x27;s giant new radar in Kaliningrad raises alarm in NATO</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">俄罗斯在波罗的海沿岸的加里宁格勒部署了一座大型新型雷达，此举引发了北约的高度关注和担忧。该雷达的战略位置和潜在能力被视为可能改变地区军事平衡，对北约安全构成挑战。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">DW(德国,中立)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261101-french-presidential-candidate-philippe-rejects-centre-right-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style