arney says he had good conversation with Trump on trade</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">加拿大总理办公室顾问、前央行行长马克·卡尼表示，他与美国前总统唐纳德·特朗普就贸易问题进行了积极对话。这可能预示着未来两国在贸易关系上潜在的沟通和谈判，以及加拿大对特朗普可能回归政坛的准备。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2334398/lacson-cautions-vs-airing-updates-on-dela-rosa-hunt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">拉克森警告勿泄露德拉罗萨搜捕行动最新进展</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Lacson cautions vs airing updates on Dela Rosa hunt</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">菲律宾参议员拉克森警告公众，不要过早公布参议员德拉罗萨搜捕行动的最新消息。此举可能是为了避免影响正在进行中的执法行动，确保其顺利进行，并防止目标人物闻风而逃。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/02/morning-mail-monday-ntwnfb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">早间新闻：前自由党人推动“一国党”扩张；房价再次下跌；澳大利亚女子橄榄球队创世界杯纪录</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Morning Mail: The ex-Liberal driving One Nation’s expansion; house prices fall again; and Jillaroos break World Cup records</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">今日要闻包括：一名前自由党成员正助力澳大利亚右翼政党“一国党”扩大影响力；全国房价持续下跌，对经济和民众财富产生影响；以及澳大利亚女子橄榄球队在世界杯上创造新纪录。这份综合性报道涵盖了政治、经济和体育等领域。（澳大利亚主流媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲卫报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/home-property/361053864/former-home-nz-horse-racing-legend-sir-patrick-hogan-grabs-225m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新西兰赛马传奇故居标价225万澳元出售</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Former home of NZ horse racing legend up for grabs for $2.25m</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一处曾属于新西兰赛马界传奇人物的故居正在挂牌出售，标价225万澳元。这则新闻不仅提供了房地产市场信息，也引起了对这位赛马传奇的纪念，并可能吸引对历史房产和赛马文化感兴趣的买家。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/11/02/acts-11th-hour-tamaki-attack-leaflet-referred-to-advertising-authority/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">行动党在塔马基的竞选传单遭举报至广告标准局</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Act’s 11th-hour Tāmaki attack leaflet referred to advertising authority</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰行动党（ACT Party）在塔马基（Tāmaki）选区发布的最后一刻竞选传单因内容争议被举报至广告标准局，这引发了对其宣传方式合规性的关注。（新西兰媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/business/2298412/south-island-businesses-report-eftpos-outages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新西兰南岛商家报告电子支付系统中断</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">South Island businesses report Eftpos outages</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰南岛多家企业报告其Eftpos电子支付系统出现故障，导致顾客无法正常支付，对当地商业运营造成影响，目前正在调查中断原因。（新西兰媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr3wv311dwnlo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">从总统到反叛领袖：约瑟夫·卡比拉的身份转变</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Suited and booted: How Joseph Kabila went from president to rebel leader</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">刚果民主共和国前总统约瑟夫·卡比拉（Joseph Kabila）在卸任后身份发生转变，有报道指出他可能扮演了反叛领袖的角色，揭示了非洲政治权力斗争的复杂性。（国际媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmqln14rrzxvo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">医院称以色列对加沙的袭击导致包括一名儿童在内的八人死亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Israeli strikes in Gaza kill eight including child, hospitals say</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">加沙地带医院报告称，以色列的空袭造成八人死亡，其中包括一名儿童，加剧了该地区的人道危机和巴以冲突的紧张局势，引发国际社会关注。（国际媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq398y0zj9rpo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">国王将在安提瓜谈论奴隶制，首相称英国对可能的道歉持开放态度</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">King to address slavery in Antigua as PM says he is open to possible UK apology</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国国王查尔斯三世访问安提瓜时将谈及奴隶制历史，而英国首相表示对可能就奴隶贸易进行道歉持开放态度，此举反映了英国对殖民历史责任的重新审视。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/1/ukraine-evacuates-civilians-in-kherson-region-as-localised-ceasefire-ends?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">局部停火结束后，赫尔松严阵以待战争重临</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Kherson braces for return of war as localised Russia-Ukraine truce ends</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">俄罗斯与乌克兰在赫尔松地区的局部停火协议终止，该城市正准备迎接战火再次爆发，当地居民和防御力量均面临巨大的不确定性和安全风险。（国际媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
